    "notes": [
      "JSON cannot contain comments. Documentation is embedded in _meta + ui_palette.docs.",
      "Palette system is a registry: ui_palette.palettes[ui_palette.active] is applied at runtime.",
      "Apply order: tokens -> derived -> alias_to_legacy_vars. This preserves existing CSS selectors (--bg/--panel/etc) without refactors.",
      "Expanded token coverage: divider, overlay (modal scrim), disabled/readonly surfaces, slider tokens (track/fill/thumb), field backgrounds.",
      "Day palette tuned for TV: larger separation between bg/surfaces + stronger borders to avoid washed-out look."
    ]
  },

